163
00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.290
and then tried to get it back, like,
弄得一模一样却没有相同的背景。

164
00:05:42.290 --> 00:05:43.970
and to look exactly the same without the same background.
不，我们当时一定就是那么做的。

165
00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:45.410
No, we had to have done it that way.
我们肯定就是那么做的。

166
00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:46.370
We had to have done it that way.
我们当时一定是跳过去拍了，然后说，

167
00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.650
We must have jumped ahead and said,
好吧，先把那个镜头拍了吧。

168
00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:49.410
okay, let's just get that scene.
对。

169
00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:49.890
Yeah.
对。

170
00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:50.130
Yeah.
我想你是对的。

171
00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:50.930
I think you're right.
对。

